+    The Evolver writes these beside the asset they verify and never references them
+    from the shipped ``config.yaml``, so they carry no behaviour and cannot be the
+    cross-bucket pollution IV-9 exists to stop. Restricted to ``.py`` on purpose: a
+    ``_``-prefixed ``.md`` could be a real prompt template.
